# Copy to /etc/groundrecall/mcp-http.env only if you customize the unit.
# The checked-in unit keeps paths explicit so systemd does not invoke a shell.
# Keep this file mode 0640 (root:groundrecall) if it contains credentials.

# For a fixed-token pilot, replace --identity-file in the unit with
# --bearer-token and keep the token out of process listings by using a
# dedicated systemd credential or a protected wrapper. Identity files are
# preferred for multiple principals; see docs/mcp-http-systemd.md.
